  "instruction": "Claude mod menu (2026-09-28): the runtime winmm.dll is now built from hook_modmenu/src (chart-menu hook + one feature set). On the first WM_INITMENU it inserts a 「모드(&M)」 popup between 「시스템」 and 「도움말」 with 이벤트 플로우 차트(&E) / 전체 개방(&U) / 전체 개방 되돌리기(&R) / — / 전체 리셋(&Z) / 전체 리셋 되돌리기(&B) (command ids = first free in 0x7E10..0x7EFF); the Help item of the chart-menu build is gone. Each item writes <exe>/KRMenu/request.txt (3 lines: cmd, seq, time; cmd in chart, unlock_all, unlock_revert, reset_all, reset_restore) which the game script consumes in its home loop (calendar r21+); the two reset items first ask through a native MessageBox. At the next start (first timer call, before the engine reads its global record files) a pending KRMenu/reset.req or restore.req is executed only when the save folder also holds YoruKR_reset.marker with the matching word: NightRAFInfo/CGMode/MemMode/BGMMode/Common .asd, NightRMsgSkip.msk, CommonGameData.asd and YoruKR_HomeRate.dat are copied to <save>/Backup/KR_reset_<time>/ (manifest.txt) and deleted (reset), or copied back from the newest such folder with the current files kept in Backup/KR_before_restore_<time>/ (restore); save slots, config files, YoruKR_Terms.dat and YoruKR_Chart.dat are never touched; the outcome is written to KRMenu/last_result.txt (ASCII). Save folder resolution: AliceStart.ini SaveFolder + InstallInfo/SaveFolderSetting.ini (type 2 = exe-relative, else Documents/AliceSoft/<GameName>/). Everything else is unchanged: same 4 exports, same IAT hooks, same 2,364-row proxy table (header sha256 757865b3…), same IME behaviour; imports add SHELL32/ole32. Build: hook_modmenu/build_all.cmd 2364. ui_hangul_input_fix.json points to this DLL: any runtime rebuild must copy it; if the IME hook changes, rebuild from hook_modmenu/src. Manual/chart/yoru_flowchart_v2.html stays as required by required_chart_menu_20260927.json until the in-game chart replaces it. No AIN/PACT/EX/FNL change.",
  "translator_model": "Claude Fable 5.1 (claude-fable-5-1)"
}
